<title>UK: Copper/zinc forge higher, fuelled by LME spreads.</title>
<headline>Copper/zinc forge higher, fuelled by LME spreads.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Pushes up above $2,280 as spread activity becomes more focussed ahead of &quot;third Wednesday&quot; pricing next week.</p>
<p>Cash/threes at $140.</p>
<p>ZINC - Races higher and could test recent 6-3/4 year high of $1,495. Contango narrows further on September tightness.</p>
</text>
